{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id153980654"}, "name":{"label":"Alexis3345"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-29T05:48:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.4"}, "id":{"label":"14485851277"}, "title":{"label":"Feature request: iPad companion app / large-screen dashboard"}, "content":{"label":"Hello Pedometer++ team,\nI really enjoy using Pedometer++. It is simple, clear, and very motivating for following my daily steps and progress. I use it with my iPhone and Apple Watch, and it has become part of my daily routine.\nI would love to see an iPad-compatible version, or even a companion dashboard for iPad. I do not expect the iPad to count steps itself; I would simply like to view, on a larger screen, the step data already collected by my iPhone and Apple Watch through Apple Health.\nIt would be especially useful to see:\n•\tToday’s step count and progress toward the daily goal\n•\tDaily, weekly, and monthly graphs\n•\tWalking distance, flights climbed, and active calories\n•\tLong-term trends and personal records\n•\tA clear, simple interface optimized for the larger iPad display\nFor people who use an iPad at home, it would be a wonderful way to review progress and stay motivated. I hope you will consider adding iPad support in a future version.\nThank you for creating such a useful app.\nWarm regards,", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
