{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id149971242"}, "name":{"label":"Yojimbo2011"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-06-09T18:38:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"8.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"14164332984"}, "title":{"label":"Was Once Great"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using the free version for over a decade. On my watch I used to be able to edit the items that showed up during my indoor and outdoor walks,  and any other workout, including step counts. Now it shows only what it thinks are the relevant items, and nothing else, including no step counts! I always thought the whole purpose of this app was to count steps. On my watch I’d like to be able to see the number of steps I get during a workout like I used to. A severe downgrade in my estimation.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
